<body>

    <h1>How to Play</h1>

    <p>Guess a combination of 4 different letters from A to H.</p>

    <p>
        A Bull means that the letter is correct and in the correct position.
    </p>

    <p>
        A Hit means that the letter exists in the secret combination,
        but is in the wrong position.
    </p>

